# experiment.json Rules

## Status Lifecycle

`wip` → `shipped` (binary lifecycle, no intermediate states)

- `wip`: dev/preview only. Excluded from all production surfaces, build outputs, and search engines.
- `shipped`: complete. Visibility determined by `listing`.

## Listing (Visibility Tier)

- `"public"` (default): full public visibility -- homepage, registry, llms.txt, posters, articles, sitemap, RSS. SEO indexed.
- `"dev"`: dev/preview homepage only. In registry and llms.txt. Articles exist but hidden from public Writing tab. `noindex`.
- `"registry"`: registry only. Not on homepage, not in llms.txt, no posters, no articles. `noindex`.

## Truth Table

```
                  | Homepage  | Homepage    | Registry | llms.txt | Posters      | Articles | SEO     |
                  | (prod)    | (dev/prev)  |          |          |              | (prod)   |         |
------------------+-----------+-------------+----------+----------+--------------+----------+---------|
wip + any         | --        | YES         | --       | --       | --           | --       | noindex |
shipped + public  | YES       | YES         | YES      | YES      | YES (if vid) | YES      | index   |
shipped + dev     | --        | YES         | YES      | YES      | --           | --       | noindex |
shipped + registry| --        | --          | YES      | --       | --           | --       | noindex |
```

## Required Fields

`title`, `description`, `slug` (kebab-case), `status`, `listing`

## Enum Values

- **status**: `wip`, `shipped`
- **listing**: `public`, `dev`, `registry`
- **profile**: `r3f-scene`, `r3f-shader`, `scrollytelling`, `interaction`, `dom-effect`, `web-audio`, `mixed`, `blank`
- **complexity**: `beginner`, `intermediate`, `advanced`

## Optional Fields

- `articleLenses`: array of `"implementation"` | `"concept"` | `"exploration"` -- advisory hint for article lenses. Not enforced by validator.

## Key Semantics

- `legacy: true`: agent policy flag for pre-announcing-v2 experiments. Ask before modifying. Zero runtime effect.
- Article existence is detected by file presence (`article/content.mdx`), not by a metadata flag.
- `poster` is computed at runtime from `video` field, not stored in JSON.
- `updated`, `inspiration`, `related` are often empty -- populate when known.
- Read `.agents/rules/experiments.md` for full isolation rules and decomposition guidance.
- Check `profile` field and read `.agents/profiles/<profile>.md` for type-specific guidance.
